		(instances (project "smartwatch" (path "/beb01c95-410f-48bb-ba94-79a262575c74/f5d15100-b171-45be-adf0-5ef6ebe6ab9f" (reference "#PWR23") (unit 1))))
	)
	(text_box "Input: VBUS comes from the OCVPB21 output (VBUS_PROT) with 1 uF (C25). CC1 and CC2 go to ground because there is no USB-C connector. The input current limit starts at 100 mA. The only settings above that are 500 mA and more, but the OCVPB21 limits at about 310 mA, so keep the nPM1300 at its 100 mA default (or set R14 to 51 Ohm for about 600 mA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 35.56 0) (size 70 14.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21a57e5c-9088-422d-bdf0-44504181b836"))
	(text_box "Buck 1 = 1.8 V from R16 (47 kOhm on VSET1). L6 2.2 uH (DCR 400 mOhm max, Isat above 350 mA), C29 10 uF (at least 4 uF effective). 200 mA maximum. PVSS1 is the power ground of buck 1; it joins ground only through net tie NT4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 52.76 0) (size 70 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6cd04e88-23c8-47ed-bf1b-a861f6f71d45"))
	(text_box "VSYS and PVDD are one net with 10 uF to PVSS1 (C27) and 10 uF to ground (C28). Never feed VSYS from outside. Never power the application from VBAT: use VSYS or VOUT1 only (datasheet)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 65.96 0) (size 70 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c5773a66-5123-4a10-853e-ef76b4f322b8"))
	(text_box "Battery: the pack must carry its own protection (over/under voltage, over current). A pack with an NTC goes on J4 pin 2. For a pack without NTC fit R17 (10 kOhm) and disable the NTC function in register BCHGDISABLESET. Thermistor type is chosen in software (10, 47 or 100 kOhm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 77.16 0) (size 70 12.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06f38730-0b55-4552-a651-156efde57d07"))
	(text_box "SW1 on SHPHLD exits Ship mode (a charger on VBUS also does) and a 10 s hold resets the system. TWI address is 0x6B. VDDIO is the 1.8 V rail and has its own 100 nF (C31). GPIO1 is the interrupt line PMIC_IRQ; the other GPIOs, LED0..2 and SW2 are open. The I2C pull-ups are on the sensors sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 92.36 0) (size 70 12.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d4859af4-023a-4fe3-8816-47c281a5385d"))
	(text_box "DECISION NEEDED (rail voltage): the nRF54L15 needs VDD of at least 1.75 V during power-on reset, but 47 kOhm on VSET1 gives 1.8 V +/-5 %, which is 1.71 V at worst. MAX86141 allows 1.7 to 2.0 V. A 1.9 V rail (1.805 to 1.995 V) fits both. Options: keep R16 and have firmware set BUCK1NORMVOUT to 1.9 V at boot, or fit 68 kOhm (2.0 V default) and lower to 1.9 V in firmware. Net name stays +1V8." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 107.56 0) (size 70 16.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df007c1d-0414-4241-894f-2f0397d93791"))
	(text_box "Open items: battery cell and connector pin order (J4), button part (SW1), QFN32 exposed pad size (footprint EP 3.45 mm, datasheet 3.5 mm nominal)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.14 126.76 0) (size 70 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b89fd863-ad4b-43f3-8e14-60b990172972"))
